\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  The sorrowful life of my world
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 my happy days are short,
\par the good  things of the heav'n above
\par shall never pass away.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. So then shall I not think on earth,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Honour, money and joy;
\par In all my troubles and my pains,
\par In Jesus I rejoice .
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-270\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  I seek not anything on earth,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 These earthly things shall pass;
\par I am so pleased in my Jesus,
\par \pard      I shall for ever live. \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

